          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ethĩwa akamanyĩthw’a naĩ yake ĩla wavĩtisye, nĩvo ĩndĩ aete mbũi yĩthĩwe nthembo yake, mbaika ĩte kĩema, kwondũ wa naĩ yake ĩla wavĩtisye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na akailĩĩle kw’oko mũtwenĩ wa nthembo ya naĩ, na kũaĩa nthembo ya naĩ vandũ vau va nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũthembi akose na kyaa kyake nthakame yayo, na kũmĩvaka mbyanĩ sya kĩthembeo kya nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a; na nthakame yonthe akamĩtulũĩle ĩtinanĩ ya kĩthembeo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mathunya onthe mayo akaumye, o tondũ mathunya maumaw’a nthembonĩ ya nthembo sya mũuo; na mũthembi akamavĩvĩsye kĩthembeonĩ methĩwe mũuke mũseo kwa Yeova; na mũthembi akathembe nthembo ya kũmwĩw’anĩthya ũsu, nake akaekewa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
