              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mathunya onthe mako akaumye, o tondũ mathunya ma katena ka ĩlondu maumaw’a nthembonĩ ya nthembo sya mũuo; na mũthembi akamavĩvĩsye kĩthembeonĩ, ĩũlũ wa nthembo sya Yeova ila ivĩvaw’a na mwaki; na mũthembi akathembe nthembo ya kũmwĩw’anĩthya ũsu nũndũ wa naĩ yake ĩla wavĩtisye, nake akaekewa.",
